      "locators": [
        "release_disposition=deferred_to_next_version; complete defining and secondary-goal sources were not obtained in the audited environment; source boundary and reopening requirements: specs/source_protocols/ordinary_crs_cross_efficiency.md",
        "Liang--Wu--Cook--Zhu (2008) Table 2 supplies a later-source CCR diagonal and aggregate profiles, but its arbitrary raw profile is not unique under alternate primary optima",
        "Internal tests exercise the production prototype and do not constitute an independent source-native numerical oracle"
      ]
    },
    "tests": {
